## 3.3 Windows Defender Exploit Guard (and Microsoft Defender Evolution)

Exploit Guard (Windows 10 1709) is a suite built into Microsoft Defender Antivirus/Endpoint: **ASR, Exploit Protection, Network Protection, Controlled Folder Access**. The brand name was retired but the features remain under Microsoft Defender for Endpoint / Windows Security. Some require Defender Antivirus as the active AV (real-time protection on).

